  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Relief For Rural Sri Lankan Households</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide emergency aid packages to support rural households in Sri Lanka devastated by a months-long economic crisis. As a result of COVID as well as poor economic and agricultural policies, Sri Lanka&apos;s currency has all but collapsed, leading to runaway inflation. Trunks &amp; Leaves is a not a humanitarian aid organization, but our staff and partners on the ground can provide each household with a month&apos;s supply of basic food, sanitation and dry rations across the country.</narrative>
  </description>
